    {
      "name": "getChat",
      "description": "Your chat, its messages first to last as AG-UI's, each assistant message's stop reason in its metadata, the operations its turns are offered, how its last run ended, busy while one runs, and its versions, the chats of its tree of forks. A chat of another app than app names, when it names one, is no such chat.",
